WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.042 --> 00:00:03.962
And the Patriots have won
their sixth Super Bowl title!

00:00:04.046 --> 00:00:05.422
Don't ever count Tom Brady out!

00:00:05.506 --> 00:00:07.591
Bill Belichick's painted
his Mona Lisa.

00:00:07.674 --> 00:00:10.761
These are the two titanic
figures of this franchise,

00:00:10.844 --> 00:00:13.514
but they are two alphas.

00:00:13.597 --> 00:00:14.765
A collision was inevitable.

00:00:15.849 --> 00:00:17.392
We were coming near the end…

00:00:19.228 --> 00:00:21.021
and I was just tryin' to

00:00:21.104 --> 00:00:23.982
hold it together
the best I could.

